  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a053155b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Business signal\n",
    "\n",
    "The category comparison makes the main story easy to see: **Electronics** has the steepest January-to-June decline, at about **35.0%**. Because it is also the largest revenue category, this movement matters during the supplier review.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Grocery** is the most consistent category by monthly coefficient of variation (**3.87%**), while **Apparel** records the strongest positive change at **34.1%**."
   ]
  },
