   "source": [
    "### What the numbers suggest\n",
    "\n",
    "Average revenue per transaction moves from **₹4,685.65 at 0% discount** to **₹3,631.73 at 20%**, a **22.5% decrease**. At the same time, average units sold stay almost unchanged (**2.59 vs 2.58**).\n",
    "\n",
    "So, in this dataset, higher discounts are not accompanied by a comparable increase in units sold. This is an **observed association rather than a causal result**. The dataset also has no product cost or gross-margin field, so actual profitability impact cannot be measured. The **25%+** bracket has no observations."
   ]
  },
