   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### MANISH — TASK CONTINUED\n",
    "\n",
    "**Discount & Sales Trend Analysis:** Continued evaluating **discount effectiveness**, **day-of-week patterns**, and **monthly sales trends** to identify important sales patterns and support business insights."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "25290671",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-09-17T04:27:31.453974Z",
