   "source": [
    "### Timing signal\n",
    "\n",
    "**Saturday** has the highest average daily revenue at chain level, while **Tuesday** is the lowest. **January** is the strongest month by total revenue and **June** is the weakest.\n",
    "\n",
    "For Electronics, the weekday pattern is similar: Saturday is strongest and Tuesday is weakest. This gives a useful timing signal for testing promotions without assuming that the timing itself causes higher sales."
   ]
  },
